WEBVTT

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:04.875
The math inside Auracle, and
why each piece has its shape.

00:00:06.629 --> 00:00:10.566
Each patch becomes forty-four
features, standardized to one scale.

00:00:10.966 --> 00:00:15.784
Utility is the maximum over a few
linear experts, never their average.

00:00:16.184 --> 00:00:21.063
So you can love dark drones and bright
plucks, and each is scored by its own best

00:00:21.063 --> 00:00:22.063
lens.

00:00:23.057 --> 00:00:25.937
Three kinds of answer
feed that one utility.

00:00:26.337 --> 00:00:30.260
A duel is Bradley-Terry, logistic
in the utility difference.

00:00:30.660 --> 00:00:34.610
Cutting a patch is a kill, judged
against a bar fitted per session.

00:00:35.010 --> 00:00:36.703
A picky day moves the bar.

00:00:36.703 --> 00:00:37.703
Not the taste.

00:00:38.015 --> 00:00:42.552
Stars fall between fitted cutpoints,
so a harsh rater moves the cutpoints.

00:00:43.771 --> 00:00:47.774
With no hidden lens labels,
every parameter is a real number.

00:00:48.174 --> 00:00:52.471
So plain Metropolis-Hastings fits
it, and keeps five hundred draws.

00:00:52.871 --> 00:00:57.399
Between fits, each answer reweights
the draws, exactly and nearly free.

00:00:57.799 --> 00:01:00.311
When the weights collapse,
it pays for a refit.

00:01:01.629 --> 00:01:05.509
Each duel is forecast before you
answer, then scored by Brier.

00:01:05.909 --> 00:01:10.296
Brier is a proper rule, so only
an honest probability scores best.

00:01:10.696 --> 00:01:13.069
Accuracy cannot see overconfidence.

00:01:13.469 --> 00:01:15.691
Each kind of evidence gets its own score.

00:01:17.343 --> 00:01:18.855
Which pair should it ask about?

00:01:19.305 --> 00:01:23.217
Picking the most informative
pair only tied random pairs.

00:01:23.217 --> 00:01:24.795
Thompson sampling lost.

00:01:25.195 --> 00:01:29.335
So pairs are random, and every
duel is also an unbiased check.

00:01:30.914 --> 00:01:36.396
Search aims at a Boltzmann target, the
grammar's prior times the exponential of beta

00:01:36.396 --> 00:01:37.897
times expected utility.

00:01:38.297 --> 00:01:42.839
The prior supplies parsimony as a
probability, not a penalty to tune.

00:01:43.239 --> 00:01:47.369
Beta, at two, is the one dial
between browsing and optimizing.

00:01:48.771 --> 00:01:52.904
Refinement is Metropolis-Hastings
on the trace, through fugue-evo.

00:01:53.304 --> 00:01:56.294
It walks forty steps from
each of the ten best patches.

00:01:56.694 --> 00:02:01.343
Keeping where each walk ends climbs the
target instead of sampling it, which suits a

00:02:01.343 --> 00:02:02.343
shortlist.

00:02:03.057 --> 00:02:04.962
A lock is exact conditioning.

00:02:05.362 --> 00:02:09.365
Moves that change, delete or create
a locked address are rejected.

00:02:09.765 --> 00:02:12.992
Checking births as well as
deaths keeps detailed balance.

00:02:14.486 --> 00:02:18.517
PERFORM's controls are fixed
directions in standardized sound.

00:02:18.517 --> 00:02:20.598
Bright is centroid plus rolloff.

00:02:20.998 --> 00:02:25.969
Each patch gets its own Jacobian from one
nudged render per knob, since knobs act

00:02:25.969 --> 00:02:27.196
differently in each.

00:02:27.596 --> 00:02:30.498
A ridge solve picks at most
four knobs for each control.

00:02:30.898 --> 00:02:35.733
Each half is then rendered for real, and
closes if it stops moving the right way.

00:02:37.343 --> 00:02:41.708
Every constant here is in the reference,
with its measurement where there is one.
